  "sourceNote": "This project reproduces the four map views generated by the Environmental Reporting BC repository. It joins the 2019 conservation-ranking table and 2018 population estimates to one shared 2018 Grizzly Bear Population Unit boundary, then summarizes mapped mortality records from 1976–2017. The reusable 59-polygon boundary comprises 55 ranked population units and four extirpated units.",
